# English Learning Tool — 每日 S3 备份 job（oneshot，由 timer 触发）
[Unit]
Description=English Learning daily backup job (SQLite snapshot to S3)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/opt/english-learning/app/apps/api
EnvironmentFile=/etc/english-learning/env
ExecStart=/opt/english-learning/app/node_modules/.bin/tsx src/jobs/daily-backup.ts
